# Files chezmoi actively deletes from $HOME on apply.
#
# Unmanaging a file only makes chezmoi ignore it; the stale copy stays in
# $HOME until it is listed here. Entries can be pruned once every machine has
# applied them.

# Replaced by conf.d/shortcuts.fish and the per-function files in functions/.
.config/fish/conf.d/functions.fish

# Dead code: starship defines fish_prompt at shell startup, so this never ran.
.config/fish/functions/fish_prompt.fish

# Note: entries listed in .chezmoiignore cannot be removed from here, because
# chezmoi ignores them entirely. ~/README.md was installed by an earlier
# version of this repo and has to be deleted by hand, once, per machine:
#     rm ~/README.md
